NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE.

This software is a measurement instrument for academic and personal research.
It does not trade, does not suggest entries, and has no execution path in any
stage. Its outputs are measurements of historical and forward-recorded public
data, reported with their sample sizes and their pre-registered bars.

Nothing produced by this software is investment advice, a recommendation, or a
solicitation to buy or sell any asset. The registered prior that this project
finds a tradeable signal is 5 to 8 percent, and the prior evidence it carries
records 97.5 percent 30-day death on birth-ordered Solana pools (n = 40).
Anyone acting on this output does so entirely at their own risk.
